re to \\($0).\" }"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The type exists so that those two are the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"same slot","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". Before it,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every line was declared as one or the other, and which one it got was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the engine’s own prose showing through the API: ","type":"text"},{"code":"dig","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" was a ","type":"text"},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"because the engine’s dig line happens to name nothing, so no game could","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"write one that did without an engine change — and that change broke","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every game which had already assigned the old shape, whether it wanted","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the name or not. Widening a line is now the business of the game that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wants it, and costs the games that don’t nothing.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Object","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" says what the line is about. A line whose every parser row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carries a direct object takes a "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun"},{"type":"text","text":" and is written with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Line\/naming(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":". One that also answers a bare command — "},{"code":"smell","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"climb","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"wake","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — takes "},{"code":"Noun?","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and is written with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Line\/naming(orBare:_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", which","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asks for both halves so neither can be left in the engine’s voice by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accident. A verb with no object slot at all takes "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Nothing"},{"type":"text","text":": there is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no name to hand it, but there is still a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"turn"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to write it in, which is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Line\/live(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is for."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Which subjects exist is ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/LineSubject","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"; how a line about each may be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"written","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is the two protocols refining it — ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/DroppableSubject","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fixed sentence, ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/NamedSubject","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for a closure. All three are protocols","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than lists in a doc comment, because a list in a doc comment is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"list somebody has to remember to edit.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The shape is therefore about what the sentence is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"given"}]},{"type":"text","text":", never about"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"how it is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"built","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Every one of them takes a string literal, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fixed spelling of any line is the same three tokens whatever slot it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sits in."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The object arrives as a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun"},{"type":"text","text":" and never as a bare string,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the reason "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Noun"},{"type":"text","text":" exists: it carries its own number, so “The rails"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is not food.” — a game’s honest plural made ungrammatical by a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"template’s assumption — cannot be written. Interpolating one prints its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"phrase, so a line with no verb to agree reads exactly as it would have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One stock line, in whichever shape the game wants it: a fixed sentence,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a sentence assembled when it prints, or one that names the thing it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"about."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Line\/init(_:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initialize